        "id": 1076123
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-13T00:00:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you\u0027re writing directly to the HAL, the HAL should receive the event.  The stack should never see it.  This is how it is done in other HALs that send commands.  It\u0027s an error to see a response to a command that wasn\u0027t sent from HCI.",
      "parentUuid": "23bc4f7a_a9d6dd14",
      "revId": "523e902e24f267962773dd79cc1fc26de9637029",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
