      "writtenOn": "2022-08-15T17:04:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ll land this only in CHROMIUM tree for now to unblock us but I\u0027d like to understand a few things:\n\n* Do HAL drivers intercept cmd/response if they need to do something vendor specific? (i.e. let\u0027s say they need to trigger some action based on remote features, would they just send a remote feature cmd and intercept response without ever sending to userspace)\n\n* How do you handle userspace tools needing HCI access? i.e. Debug tooling using vendor specific events that only exist in userspace.",
      "parentUuid": "c69d86e5_58d704ae",
      "revId": "523e902e24f267962773dd79cc1fc26de9637029",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    }
